NetBird tray icons
==================

The PNGs in this directory are the official NetBird system-tray icons, taken
unmodified from the NetBird client:

    https://github.com/netbirdio/netbird
    commit 11733fd718fb7889cfbf8b4e6498c0b4e74a1eb0 (2026-08-28)
    path   client/ui/assets/

